      "title": "Add SRCMNT (SourceMint) on Base",
      "author": "khalidsaidi",
      "number": 1358,
      "body": "Adds the SRCMNT token (SourceMint) on Base mainnet.\n\nOn-chain values verified against Base mainnet:\n- name: SourceMint\n- symbol: SRCMNT\n- decimals: 18\n- address: 0x914F6b6a0DaD39A3CB932dcf4D1af885C7c08EeB\n- total supply: 1,000,000 (fixed; minted once at deployment, no mint function)\n- website: https://srcmnt.xyz\n\nNotes for reviewers:\n- `nobridge: true` is set. The token was deployed natively on Base with Foundry, not via the standard bridge factory, so it has no L1 counterpart and should not appear in the bridge UI.\n- Source code is verified on BaseScan and Blockscout.\n- Logo is SVG at 256x256.\n- `npx tsx ./bin/cli.ts validate --datadir ./data --tokens SRCMNT` passes locally.\n\nContract: https://basescan.org/address/0x914f6b6a0dad39a3cb932dcf4d1af885c7c08eeb#code\nRepository: https://github.com/khalidsaidi/sourcemint\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_012mggwNhgEyvfn1q6Lrdk3Q",
